        "cooked": "<p>Mint.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Same experience as others--using End of Days right off the bat is key. Then&nbsp;Wraith can freely use the Infrared Eyepiece to avoid all of the nasties (Truth, Anvil, Devastating Aurora, etc.) Using a Utility Belt,&nbsp;Rook City Wraith's base power was also helpful.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Rook City Wraith 16HP, XPW Fanatic 18HP and Young Legacy 14HP.</p>",
