        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/seesome/{size}/2018_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-09-22T15:30:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm all for EoD on the 1st round in general anyway as it evens the playing field. &nbsp;<span>If you hold it for later use, you end up wiping your own stuff out along with the villain cards and I hate having to do that. &nbsp;For me EoD is either a 1st turn card or something to save for villains that can dump a ton of cards out all at once (e.g. Infinitor, Akash'buta, Matriarch, Voss) and I need some way to counter that. &nbsp;Dawn can be tough, but evening the playing field early is generally the best move - esp. when you can get out Infrared Goggles and block her worst cards from coming out later.</span></p>",
